    <string name="suggestions_follow">Suggestions after the queue</string>
    <string name="suggestions_help">When you start an album, a few tracks close to your library are added behind it in the queue, marked with a star: skip the ones you do not want to hear. More are added when the queue is about to end, and 10 at a time when you scroll the queue down. With the amplifier, the server adds them: the music goes on even when the app is closed, and the setting applies to every phone. The server can ask Last.fm if a key is configured on it: it then sends the artist and the title.</string>
